{"id":"4cc05e68647fcda4","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-henkin-sentence.md","title":"Henkin Sentence","display":"df-henkin-sentence — Henkin Sentence","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-henkin-sentence","aliases":["89-df-henkin-sentence"],"display":"df-henkin-sentence — Henkin Sentence","depends_on":["[[89-df-provability-predicate]]","[[89-df-provable-formula]]","[[88-df-diagonal-lemma]]","[[88-df-godel-numbering]]","[[88-df-numeral]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-henkin-sentence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-henkin-sentence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-henkin-sentence — Henkin Sentence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"841985de31202f85\" href=\"?note=841985de31202f85\" title=\"89-df-provability-predicate\">89-df-provability-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2d52ad4f119b4a14\" href=\"?note=2d52ad4f119b4a14\" title=\"89-df-provable-formula\">89-df-provable-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"268c5641ccf6ec59\" href=\"?note=268c5641ccf6ec59\" title=\"88-df-diagonal-lemma\">88-df-diagonal-lemma</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"56061e16f3fb8bfd\" href=\"?note=56061e16f3fb8bfd\" title=\"88-df-godel-numbering\">88-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"69c0e9e2e8f423a6\" href=\"?note=69c0e9e2e8f423a6\" title=\"88-df-numeral\">88-df-numeral</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}\\)</span> is a recursively axiomatized arithmetical theory extending PA.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}(x)\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}(x)\\)</span> is its fixed arithmetical provability formula and\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T)\\)</span> its set of provable sentences.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\\)</span> is the fixed Gödel numbering and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar n\">\\(\\bar n\\)</span> is the numeral denoting <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}henkin\\text{-}sentence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Henkin}(T)\n\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\nH\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}\n\\ \\middle|\\\n\\bigl(H\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}(\\overline{\\ulcorner H\\urcorner})\\bigr)\n\\in\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T)\n\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}henkin\\text{-}sentence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Henkin}(T)\n\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\nH\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}\n\\ \\middle|\\\n\\bigl(H\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}(\\overline{\\ulcorner H\\urcorner})\\bigr)\n\\in\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T)\n\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span> : Henkin句子</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner H\\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner H\\urcorner\\)</span> 是元层自然数，而\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_T(\\overline{\\ulcorner H\\urcorner})\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_T(\\overline{\\ulcorner H\\urcorner})\\)</span> 才是对象语言中的句子。</li>\n<li>Henkin句子声称自己可证</li>\n<li>与 Gödel 句子的\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_T(\\overline{\\ulcorner G\\urcorner})\">\\(\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_T(\\overline{\\ulcorner G\\urcorner})\\)</span> 对比。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"841985de31202f85","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-provability-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-provable-formula","status":"resolved","id":"2d52ad4f119b4a14","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-provable-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-diagonal-lemma","status":"resolved","id":"268c5641ccf6ec59","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-diagonal-lemma]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"56061e16f3fb8bfd","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"69c0e9e2e8f423a6","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-numeral]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar n","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}henkin\\text{-}sentence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Henkin}(T)\n\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\nH\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}\n\\ \\middle|\\\n\\bigl(H\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}(\\overline{\\ulcorner H\\urcorner})\\bigr)\n\\in\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T)\n\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"H","display":false},{"tex":"\\ulcorner H\\urcorner","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_T(\\overline{\\ulcorner H\\urcorner})","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_T(\\overline{\\ulcorner G\\urcorner})","display":false}],"bytes":1304,"backlinks":[{"id":"f04ebe4ce16b21f5","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-289","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-henkin-sentence]]"}],"outgoing":["841985de31202f85","2d52ad4f119b4a14","268c5641ccf6ec59","56061e16f3fb8bfd","69c0e9e2e8f423a6"]}